# Prettier is run with `--ignore-path .gitignore --ignore-path .prettierignore`,
# so this file only needs the things git tracks but prettier must not rewrite.

# Lockfiles are npm's output, not ours. Reformatting them creates noisy diffs
# and risks confusing the resolver.
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json

# Generated or vendored
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.expo/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
data/

# Bicep parameter output and k8s templates use their own conventions
**/*.bicepparam

# The binding API contract. Read-only for every lane; formatting is an edit,
# and reflowing its tables is not worth the risk of a semantic diff.
docs/API.md
